# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets redirects file. Only relative source
# paths are allowed here (a host-based rule like
# "https://mouhcinezhirou.com/*  ->  https://www..." errors out at deploy
# with "Only relative URLs are allowed" — that's zone-level routing, not
# asset routing). The apex -> www redirect is instead configured as a
# Cloudflare Redirect Rule on the zone (Rules -> Redirect Rules in the
# dashboard) — it runs at the edge before any asset is served, so it
# belongs there, not here.

# "/fr" used to be the French homepage; French now lives at "/". 301 this
# so the SEO equity already built up on "/fr" carries over.
/fr       /            301
/fr/*     /:splat      301
